Warning: Jet.SliceCopyInLoop: Slicing inside a loop copies every time
  --> Tests/UILint/slice_in_loop.jet:4:18
    |
  4 |         piece: xs[i..i]
    |                  ^^^^^^
 Why: Each slice makes a fresh copy of the range — that adds up in a loop
 Fix: Build indices outside the loop, or collect into one list
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.SliceCopyInLoop
